if ! command -v gitleaks >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  cat <<'EOF' >&2
gitleaks is not installed, so staged changes cannot be scanned for secrets before commit.

Install it, then retry:
  macOS           brew install gitleaks
  Linux/Windows   see https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks#installing (no apt/choco
                  package; grab a release binary, or `go install
                  github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks/v8@latest`)

See CONTRIBUTING.md for what this hook checks and how to handle a false positive.
EOF
  exit 1
fi

gitleaks protect --staged --redact -v
